    <statement><p>Use logarithms to find an exact solution to the equation below.</p>
<p><m>e^{0.08 t} = 22</m></p>
<p><m>t =</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>\frac{\ln\mathopen{}\left(22\right)}{0.08}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><alert>  SOLUTION </alert>



Using the log rules, we have
<me>\begin{aligned}
e^{0.08 t} \amp = 22 \\
\ln{ \left( e^{0.08 t} \right)} \amp = \ln{(22)} \\
0.08 t \amp = \ln{(22)} \\
t \amp = \frac{\ln{(22)}}{0.08}
\end{aligned}</me>



</solution>
